<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>Choosimple is designed to help readers make clearer product decisions with less noise and fewer unnecessary comparisons.</p>

<p>This page explains what information may be collected when you visit Choosimple and how that information may be used.</p>

<h2>Affiliate Links</h2>

<p>Some links on Choosimple may be affiliate links. This means Choosimple may earn a commission if you purchase a product through certain links, at no additional cost to you.</p>

<p>As an Amazon Associate, Choosimple earns from qualifying purchases.</p>

<p>Affiliate relationships do not directly determine product decisions. Recommendations are based on long-term ownership patterns, reliability, usability, and overall purchase logic for most buyers.</p>

<h2>Analytics and Usage Data</h2>

<p>Choosimple may use analytics tools or hosting analytics to understand general website traffic and usage patterns. This can include information such as:</p>

<ul>
<li>Pages visited</li>
<li>Approximate geographic region</li>
<li>Device or browser type</li>
<li>Referral sources</li>
<li>General interaction data</li>
</ul>

<p>This information is used to improve the website experience, understand which content is useful, and improve site performance over time.</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>

<p>Third-party services, including affiliate programs and analytics providers, may use cookies or similar technologies to track activity related to affiliate purchases, website traffic, or performance measurement.</p>

<p>You can usually manage or disable cookies through your browser settings.</p>

<h2>Email Updates</h2>

<p>If you choose to subscribe to updates in the future, your email address may be stored and used for occasional updates related to Choosimple content, new categories, or major site improvements.</p>

<p>Your information will not be sold to third parties.</p>

<h2>Third-Party Websites</h2>

<p>Choosimple links to third-party websites, including retailers and affiliate partners. Choosimple is not responsible for the privacy practices, content, or policies of external websites.</p>

<h2>Policy Updates</h2>

<p>This privacy policy may be updated periodically as the website evolves.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>

<p>If you have questions regarding this policy, you can contact Choosimple through the contact page.</p>
</div>
</div>
